0,Austronesian peoples - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Austronesian_peoples,"The Austronesian peoples, sometimes referred to as Austronesian-speaking peoples, [45] are a large collection of peoples who speak Austronesian languages, having settled in Taiwan, maritime Southeast Asia, parts of mainland Southeast Asia, Micronesia, coastal New Guinea, Island Melanesia, Polynesia, and Madagascar. [46][47] They also include indigenous ethnic minorities in Vietnam, Cambodia ...",Cia-Cia,Austronesian
1,Cia-Cia language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cia-Cia_language,"Cia-Cia, also known as (South) Buton or Butonese, is an Austronesian language spoken principally around the city of Baubau on the southern tip of Buton island, off the southeast coast of Sulawesi, in Indonesia. [2]",Cia-Cia,Austronesian
